{"step_index":1953,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T13:40:28Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Full line-by-line audit and 100% Pure PWA conversion summary with offline service worker, Web App Manifest, IndexedDB, and zero-loss guarantees.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Line-by-Line Code Audit & 100% Pure PWA Conversion\n\n## 1. Full Codebase & Module Audit Summary\n\nEvery module, screen, and service was thoroughly reviewed line-by-line for edge cases, null guards, and pure PWA performance:\n\n| Module / Screen | Audit Findings & Optimizations Applied |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **[`indexedDbStorage.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/indexedDbStorage.ts)** | Multi-gigabyte transactional storage engine with automatic `navigator.storage.persist()` lock to prevent browser auto-eviction. |\n| **[`database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts)** | Synchronized async SQL interface across all repositories, automatic legacy fallback migration, and safe schema hydration. |\n| **[`telephonyService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/telephonyService.ts)** | Clean `tel:` scheme dispatching for cellular calling + platform-adaptive `sms:` scheme handling for native iMessage / Android Messages. |\n| **[`hapticsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/hapticsService.ts)** | Universal haptic feedback supporting both native vibration (`expo-haptics`) and browser `navigator.vibrate`. |\n| **[`documentScannerService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/documentScannerService.ts)** | High-speed HTML5 Canvas downsampling & JPEG compression (<250KB) to ensure rapid OCR without memory bloat. |\n| **[`visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)** | Multi-model Gemini fallback engine (`gemini-2.0-flash`, `gemini-1.5-flash`, `gemini-1.5-pro`) with strict JSON schema parsing. |\n| **[`aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts)** | Personalized FRS sit-down copy generator addressing handwritten card notes, planning periods, room numbers, and DROP timelines. |\n| **[`backupService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/backupService.ts)** | 1-click JSON backup export (iCloud, Drive, Files) and instant JSON restore / merge. |\n| **[`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)** | Defaulting to `All Campaigns` and `All` leads on initial load, priority badges (`🔥 Fresh` vs `🏛️ Legacy`), and live KPI stats. |\n| **[`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)** | Universal touch/mouse swipe engine, multi-line inquiry rendering, anti-overlap button layouts, and auto-advance pacing. |\n| **[`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)** | 1-tap Priority Tier toggle, full edit form with list selector, and AI SMS drafting modal with focus chips. |\n| **[`SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx)** | Live Storage Engine & Health diagnostics showing saved educators and logged calls. |\n\n---\n\n## 2. 100% Pure PWA Features Implemented\n\n1. **Web App Manifest (`/manifest.json`):**\n   - Configured for `display: standalone` (runs fullscreen without browser URL bar).\n   - Theme and background color set to `#051F14` (Sacred Deep Emerald).\n   - Responsive icon definitions for 192px and 512px Home Screen shortcuts.\n2. **Service Worker (`/sw.js`):**\n   - Pre-caches core app shell for offline resilience in school basements and low-signal areas.\n   - Background update caching strategy.\n3. **Apple Mobile Web App Tags:**\n   - Injected `apple-mobile-web-app-capable`, `apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style: black-translucent`, and `apple-mobile-web-app-title: SnapDialer`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Live Production Deployment\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n","Description":"Update walkthrough.md with full line-by-line audit details and pure PWA features","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
