{"step_index":1966,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T17:36:49Z","thinking":"**Listing Active Models**\n\nI've just compiled a prioritized list of active models within the Gemini API. Dynamic discovery confirmed that `gemini-2.5-flash` leads, followed by `gemini-2.5-pro`, then `gemini-2.0-flash`, and finally, `gemini-2.0-flash-lite`. This provides a clear picture of the currently available options.\n\n\n**Expanding Model Options**\n\nI've expanded the active model list with `gemini-1.5-flash-latest`, `gemini-1.5-pro-latest`, `gemini-3.7-flash`, `gemini-3.6-flash`, and `gemini-3.5-flash`. To manage this, I'm crafting a dynamic model discovery helper function in a new service, or perhaps directly within `visionService.ts` and `aiSmsService.ts`, incorporating caching for efficiency. I'm aiming for a fallback list in the function.\n\n\n**Refining Model Discovery**\n\nI've just added error handling to my dynamic model discovery process. Now, if the API call fails, it gracefully falls back to a pre-defined list. This ensures availability even if there's a hiccup with the Google API. The sorting logic still prioritizes \"flash\" models. Furthermore, I've incorporated caching to enhance performance.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@\"\n/**\n * Dynamic Google Gemini API Model Discovery Service\n * Queries the live Google Gemini API endpoint to retrieve all currently active, available models\n * for the user's API key and prioritizes ultra-fast Flash vision models.\n */\n\nexport class GeminiModelService {\n  private static cachedModels: string[] | null = null;\n  private static cacheTimestamp: number = 0;\n\n  /**\n   * Retrieves active models dynamically from the Google Generative Language API\n   */\n  static async getActiveModels(apiKey: string): Promise<string[]> {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    // Cache for 1 hour to prevent unnecessary API overhead\n    if (this.cachedModels && this.cachedModels.length > 0 && (now - this.cacheTimestamp < 3600000)) {\n      return this.cachedModels;\n    }\n\n    const fallbackList = [\n      'gemini-2.5-flash',\n      'gemini-2.5-pro',\n      'gemini-2.0-flash',\n      'gemini-2.0-flash-lite',\n      'gemini-1.5-flash-latest',\n      'gemini-1.5-pro-latest',\n      'gemini-3.7-flash',\n      'gemini-3.6-flash',\n      'gemini-3.5-flash',\n    ];\n\n    try {\n      const endpoint = `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models?key=${apiKey.trim()}`;\n      const response = await fetch(endpoint);\n      if (response.ok) {\n        const data = await response.json();\n        const available: string[] = (data?.models || [])\n          .filter((m: any) => m.supportedGenerationMethods?.includes('generateContent'))\n          .map((m: any) => m.name.replace(/^models\\//, ''));\n\n        if (available.length > 0) {\n          // Sort so high-speed flash vision models are tried first\n          const sorted = available.sort((a, b) => {\n            const aName = a.toLowerCase();\n            const bName = b.toLowerCase();\n\n            // Give highest priority to modern flash models (2.5-flash, 2.0-flash, 3.x-flash)\n            const aScore = aName.includes('2.5-flash') ? 100 : aName.includes('2.0-flash') ? 90 : aName.includes('flash') ? 80 : 50;\n            const bScore = bName.includes('2.5-flash') ? 100 : bName.includes('2.0-flash') ? 90 : bName.includes('flash') ? 80 : 50;\n\n            return bScore - aScore;\n          });\n\n          this.cachedModels = sorted;\n          this.cacheTimestamp = now;\n          return sorted;\n        }\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('Live Gemini model discovery note, using active fallback list:', e);\n    }\n\n    this.cachedModels = fallbackList;\n    this.cacheTimestamp = now;\n    return fallbackList;\n  }\n}\n\"@ | Set-Content -Path \"src/services/geminiModelService.ts\" -Encoding utf8\n","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Creating geminiModelService.ts","toolSummary":"Create geminiModelService.ts"}}]}
