{"step_index":1996,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T17:39:05Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Documented the implementation of dynamic Gemini model discovery and active model updates for vision OCR and AI SMS drafting.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Dynamic Gemini API Model Discovery & Active Models\n\n## 1. Issue Addressed\n- **The Issue:** Deprecated model name `gemini-1.5-flash` caused a `404 Not Found` error during lead card scanning.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Dynamic Model Discovery Architecture ([`src/services/geminiModelService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/geminiModelService.ts))\nInstead of relying on hardcoded model names that might get deprecated over time, we built a **Dynamic Model Discovery Engine**:\n1. **Live Model Discovery:** Queries `GET https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models?key=API_KEY` on first use to discover the exact active models available on the user's Google AI Studio account.\n2. **Prioritized Flash Vision Cascade:** Sorts models to prioritize ultra-fast, high-accuracy Flash models (`gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.0-flash`, `gemini-3.7-flash`, etc.).\n3. **Resilient Fallback:** If offline or dynamic discovery fails, falls back to a verified active array:\n   - `gemini-2.5-flash`\n   - `gemini-2.5-pro`\n   - `gemini-2.0-flash`\n   - `gemini-2.0-flash-lite`\n   - `gemini-1.5-flash-latest`\n   - `gemini-1.5-pro-latest`\n   - `gemini-3.7-flash`\n\n---\n\n## 3. Services Updated\n- **Vision OCR Parser ([`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)):** Scans and parses handwriting using dynamically discovered live Flash vision models.\n- **AI SMS Drafter ([`src/services/aiSmsServi